    "answer": {
      "short": "$8$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f'(4)&=\\lim_{x\\to4}\\frac{f(x)-f(4)}{x-4}\\\\f'(4)&=\\lim_{x\\to4}\\frac{x^2-16}{x-4}\\\\f'(4)&=\\lim_{x\\to4}(x+4)\\\\f'(4)&=8\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe tangent gradient is $8$.",
